  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the chimney sweep has become an icon for the downtrodden, and will not fail in his quest to protect those whose lives are in danger. When in a town with a danger rating of more than +0, you gain a morale bonus to AC and attack rolls equal to half the amount that the danger rating is above +0 (minimum 1).</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/chimney-sweep#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
